{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"Removed all four legacy deposit identifiers from source and tests. Added `notifyHook` for booking creation and cancellation. Each group room emits its own booking total, and cancellation emits the refund amount.\n\nBooking changes commit only after all required hooks succeed. A thrown hook error propagates, leaves every room in a failed group unbooked, and preserves a reservation when cancellation fails. The service also rejects booking changes attempted from inside a hook to prevent overlapping reservations.\n\n`run_checks.mjs` exited 0 with **21 tests passed**, including exact event payloads, failure on the second group notification, and successful retries."}}
